Fillet ladder: try each edge chain alone, then all the good ones together; where a radius fails, use the largest radius that works there and report it; 12 s time limit per group. Edges that worked are remembered for rebuilds.
Done when
Bracket lip, floor and edge fillets and the Stage 3 vane root fillets all build with a valid solid inside the time limit, and no build fails because of a fillet.
