Prerequisites
MeshSolid 2.0.x mesh-to-solid upgrades (including 2.0.5 fillets) and the add/remove feature.
Phase 0 inputs
One complete sample set (scan mesh, MeshSolid solid, Metrology output and deviation STLs, generating scripts) plus whether Metrology can be triggered from code.
Reused from BuildAgentOllama v2.5.0
Review-before-run approval flow, retry loop, job logs and example library.
Later
Quad remesh quality from 3DSRE's notes: quads follow curvature, creases kept sharp, and mesh defects pushed apart or to the boundary before surfacing. Then the drone curved-skin backlog.
Then an optional Make Drawing step using draftwright 0.6 (github.com/pzfreo/draftwright), run as a separately installed program because of its AGPL-3.0 licence.
Starting proposals you can change: 5 minutes for Stage 3, ±1% Metrology tolerance, 1% volume, 95% within ±0.1 mm, 90% recall, 80% overnight full-accuracy solids. The balance-cut depth and area caps and the gate class numbers are set with you in 2.0.1 and 2.0.2.
